305
00:32:52,120 --> 00:32:53,720
ask for permission first.

306
00:33:14,600 --> 00:33:16,440
Do I need to resign now?

307
00:33:18,360 --> 00:33:18,840
No!

308
00:33:18,960 --> 00:33:19,800
I can't!

309
00:33:20,360 --> 00:33:23,040
I haven't even been here a month!

310
00:33:23,920 --> 00:33:27,120
I can't lose my head just because my boss is so charming!

311
00:33:56,800 --> 00:33:58,760
Okay, Namhom, one more shot!

312
00:33:58,760 --> 00:34:01,360
Sexy and confident. Ready?

313
00:34:01,600 --> 00:34:03,160
One, two, three!

314
00:34:03,640 --> 00:34:05,200
Okay, beautiful!

315
00:34:05,200 --> 00:34:06,720
Let's shoot one vertically.

316
00:34:08,120 --> 00:34:10,000
Okay, one more!

317
00:34:10,400 --> 00:34:11,880
Ready? Okay!

318
00:34:11,880 --> 00:34:14,320
Beautiful, Namhom!

319
00:34:14,480 --> 00:34:17,120
Crew, let's take five to reset the lights.

320
00:34:23,560 --> 00:34:24,480
Hello!

321
00:34:27,440 --> 00:34:30,920
That was amazing! I recorded it. Look!

322
00:34:31,360 --> 00:34:32,800
Here's some cold water.

323
00:34:33,199 --> 00:34:34,600
Um, excuse me.

324
00:34:34,800 --> 00:34:36,400
For Namhom's water,

325
00:34:36,400 --> 00:34:38,920
could we have it at room temperature instead?

326
00:34:38,920 --> 00:34:41,199
Water this cold

327
00:34:41,199 --> 00:34:43,320
could dry out her throat. Of course.

328
00:34:43,520 --> 00:34:44,520
Of course!

329
00:34:45,880 --> 00:34:47,159
Hey, crew!

330
00:34:47,159 --> 00:34:49,480
Please bring her some room-temperature water.

331
00:34:50,560 --> 00:34:52,960
Anything's fine. I'm easygoing.

332
00:34:55,120 --> 00:34:56,120
And one more thing...

333
00:34:56,400 --> 00:34:58,240
Those flashes were really bright.

334
00:34:58,440 --> 00:35:00,520
They must have hurt her eyes.

335
00:35:00,960 --> 00:35:02,920
Could she rest her eyes for two minutes?

336
00:35:03,120 --> 00:35:04,000
No problem.

337
00:35:04,120 --> 00:35:05,760
And could we get a towel to dab her sweat?

338
00:35:05,760 --> 00:35:07,320
An ultra-soft one, please.

339
00:35:07,320 --> 00:35:10,120
Could you use a super-soft towel to dab the sweat along her hairline?

340
00:35:10,480 --> 00:35:12,240
Because regular tissues

341
00:35:12,480 --> 00:35:13,920
could irritate her face.

342
00:35:13,920 --> 00:35:15,360
Anything is fine, really.

343
00:35:15,760 --> 00:35:16,480
I'm easygoing.

344
00:35:16,480 --> 00:35:16,960
Um...

345
00:35:16,960 --> 00:35:19,440
Sorry for making you all run around so much.

346
00:35:19,440 --> 00:35:20,960
It's been a tiring day.

347
00:35:21,440 --> 00:35:23,040
After we finish this set,

348
00:35:23,040 --> 00:35:26,040
I'll treat the whole crew to bubble tea!

349
00:35:26,040 --> 00:35:26,600
How does that sound?

350
00:35:26,800 --> 00:35:28,560
It's no trouble at all.

351
00:35:28,560 --> 00:35:33,400
I'll find you an extra-soft towel.

352
00:35:34,080 --> 00:35:36,320
Anything is fine! I'm easygoing.

353
00:35:36,760 --> 00:35:37,960
Really, anything is fine.

354
00:35:38,240 --> 00:35:39,040
Thank you.

355
00:35:39,840 --> 00:35:40,920
Shall we take a picture?

356
00:35:42,080 --> 00:35:42,880
Of course!

357
00:36:06,200 --> 00:36:07,040
Oh my gosh!

358
00:36:07,240 --> 00:36:09,280
Look at her glow, Pim!

359
00:36:09,440 --> 00:36:11,440
She's so gorgeous and adorable.

360
00:36:12,000 --> 00:36:14,040
She's a star with real magnetism,

361
00:36:14,240 --> 00:36:16,880
the kind that makes people open their wallets

362
00:36:17,080 --> 00:36:18,760
even when they weren't planning to spend a thing.

363
00:36:19,760 --> 00:36:21,040
Well, obviously!

364
00:36:21,240 --> 00:36:22,960
Why else would Ratee

365
00:36:23,160 --> 00:36:28,360
pick Namhom as a top candidate for the new cosmetics campaign?

366
00:36:29,200 --> 00:36:30,360
It's a high-end brand.

367
00:36:30,360 --> 00:36:33,440
They need someone with a premium image like hers.

368
00:36:35,760 --> 00:36:36,640
Nui!

369
00:36:36,840 --> 00:36:37,400
Tone it down.

370
00:36:37,760 --> 00:36:39,000
Keep up appearances!

371
00:36:39,240 --> 00:36:40,720
Other staff might see you

372
00:36:40,720 --> 00:36:41,560
and start gossiping.

373
00:36:41,720 --> 00:36:42,840
I don't care!

374
00:36:43,240 --> 00:36:44,280
Alice, look!

375
00:36:44,520 --> 00:36:46,000
She's beautiful and adorable.

376
00:36:46,000 --> 00:36:47,600
Put her next to the product,

377
00:36:47,800 --> 00:36:49,040
and it'll practically sell itself.

378
00:36:49,240 --> 00:36:51,000
We wouldn't even need to push the content.

379
00:36:52,280 --> 00:36:53,560
She really is beautiful and cute.

380
00:36:54,160 --> 00:36:54,760
Right?

381
00:36:55,000 --> 00:36:56,360
I'm a huge fan of hers!

382
00:36:56,360 --> 00:36:57,440
I've never been to a fan meeting,

383
00:36:57,440 --> 00:36:59,960
but I won't miss the next one.

384
00:37:02,040 --> 00:37:04,000
Look at her! See what I mean?

385
00:37:06,320 --> 00:37:07,600
Namhom is...

386
00:37:08,200 --> 00:37:08,880
quite pretty.

387
00:37:09,840 --> 00:37:10,200
But...

388
00:37:10,200 --> 00:37:11,040
I think...

389
00:37:11,040 --> 00:37:13,520
