390
00:37:18,000 --> 00:37:19,320
You have a point, Fun.

391
00:37:19,720 --> 00:37:22,000
A lot of people online say

392
00:37:22,000 --> 00:37:23,640
Namhom is beautiful,

393
00:37:23,840 --> 00:37:24,960
but not very smart.

394
00:37:25,480 --> 00:37:26,280
I mean,

395
00:37:26,520 --> 00:37:28,640
