396
00:37:28,640 --> 00:37:32,440
And at events, she can never explain the products well.

397
00:37:32,840 --> 00:37:34,160
All she has going for her is her looks.

398
00:37:39,280 --> 00:37:41,040
Yeah, yeah, okay!

399
00:37:41,880 --> 00:37:43,040
Forget what people online say.

400
00:37:43,040 --> 00:37:43,960
Let people online say what they want.

401
00:37:45,000 --> 00:37:46,040
Let's focus on our own work.

402
00:37:48,240 --> 00:37:49,400
Hey, you guys!

403
00:37:49,920 --> 00:37:52,880
The other campaign sections due this afternoon...

404
00:37:53,200 --> 00:37:54,640
have you checked them yet?

405
00:37:54,840 --> 00:37:55,520
The campaign?

406
00:37:55,840 --> 00:37:57,360
Right, the campaign. Check!

407
00:37:57,600 --> 00:37:59,520
For the presenter section,

408
00:37:59,520 --> 00:38:00,760
I'd like to propose

409
00:38:00,760 --> 00:38:02,840
Namhom as our main candidate.

410
00:38:03,040 --> 00:38:04,080
She's beautiful,

411
00:38:04,240 --> 00:38:05,200
adorable,

412
00:38:05,600 --> 00:38:07,680
and has a strong fanbase.

413
00:38:08,240 --> 00:38:10,520
Our engagement and sales

414
00:38:10,520 --> 00:38:12,720
will definitely exceed all targets.

415
00:38:18,680 --> 00:38:19,440
Her image

416
00:38:19,440 --> 00:38:21,440
and fanbase numbers look good.

417
00:38:23,400 --> 00:38:24,680
But if the public sees Namhom

418
00:38:24,680 --> 00:38:26,840
as just a pretty face

419
00:38:27,080 --> 00:38:28,080
who doesn't know much

420
00:38:29,320 --> 00:38:31,200
or can't explain product ingredients,

421
00:38:31,200 --> 00:38:32,640
as the rumors suggest,

422
00:38:33,120 --> 00:38:34,400
how will the brand respond

423
00:38:34,400 --> 00:38:36,200
and repair that perception?

424
00:38:53,920 --> 00:38:55,440
Since there's a weakness,

425
00:38:56,800 --> 00:38:58,640
I'd like to propose Prem as well,

426
00:38:59,160 --> 00:39:01,760
a rising beauty blogger.

427
00:39:02,800 --> 00:39:05,240
She has extensive cosmetics knowledge

428
00:39:06,040 --> 00:39:07,640
and a loyal following

429
00:39:08,120 --> 00:39:10,240
that really trusts what she says.

430
00:39:14,160 --> 00:39:16,160
Even though she has some online controversies

431
00:39:16,440 --> 00:39:18,640
for being outspoken,

432
00:39:19,040 --> 00:39:20,280
overconfident,

433
00:39:21,200 --> 00:39:23,480
and sometimes arguing with netizens.

434
00:39:24,560 --> 00:39:27,280
Prem has what Namhom lacks.

435
00:39:27,680 --> 00:39:29,560
Namhom has star appeal,

436
00:39:30,080 --> 00:39:32,080
while Prem has credibility.

437
00:39:33,240 --> 00:39:35,640
Putting them together in one campaign

438
00:39:35,640 --> 00:39:37,600
would give Ratee's cosmetics both emotion and reason.

439
00:39:37,600 --> 00:39:39,000
Both emotion

440
00:39:39,800 --> 00:39:42,040
and reason in perfect balance.

441
00:39:45,920 --> 00:39:46,920
Then how about

442
00:39:47,400 --> 00:39:48,640
we keep it simple?

443
00:39:48,760 --> 00:39:49,680
I think

444
00:39:49,920 --> 00:39:51,440
we should just have Prem

445
00:39:51,720 --> 00:39:54,720
explain all the product benefits,

446
00:39:54,720 --> 00:39:56,720
and Namhom can

447
00:39:57,520 --> 00:39:58,520
just sit there...

448
00:39:58,880 --> 00:40:00,760
and smile beautifully,

449
00:40:00,920 --> 00:40:03,880
while holding the product beside her.

450
00:40:04,200 --> 00:40:05,280
Easy enough, right?

451
00:40:08,200 --> 00:40:09,280
If even we,

452
00:40:09,360 --> 00:40:11,560
as the agency designing this campaign,

453
00:40:11,960 --> 00:40:14,160
see our presenter so superficially,

454
00:40:15,280 --> 00:40:16,440
the audience will think

455
00:40:16,520 --> 00:40:18,000
and see her the same way.

456
00:40:41,040 --> 00:40:42,720
If the real Namhom

457
00:40:42,960 --> 00:40:44,480
isn't intelligent

458
00:40:44,480 --> 00:40:46,360
and knows nothing about the product,

459
00:40:46,480 --> 00:40:47,760
that would be really hard for her.

460
00:40:48,080 --> 00:40:50,800
But Namhom works harder than most people think.

461
00:40:51,000 --> 00:40:51,880
How would you know?

462
00:40:52,160 --> 00:40:52,840
Unless...

463
00:40:53,760 --> 00:40:55,120
Hello, everyone!

464
00:40:55,720 --> 00:40:57,160
Namhom is here!

465
00:40:58,720 --> 00:40:59,880
Ms. Namhom

466
00:41:00,120 --> 00:41:01,440
seems to listen to you.

467
00:41:01,920 --> 00:41:03,400
Maybe it's because I

468
00:41:03,640 --> 00:41:05,240
explain things directly

469
00:41:05,320 --> 00:41:06,760
and give easy-to-follow briefs.

470
00:41:07,200 --> 00:41:08,840
You're really bad at lying, aren't you?

471
00:41:09,360 --> 00:41:11,000
You're good at comforting the presenter.
